WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:08.700
There are some people who go to great lanes
to look like their favorite Disney characters.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:13.420
And then there are others who look like the 
animated characters without even trying.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:15.060
These everyday people and celebs...

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:20.620
...are the carbon copies of some of the most 
popular Disney princesses, princes, heroes and villains.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:25.480
If you're new to our channel, don't forget to subscribe.
And please give this video a big thumbs up.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:30.360
Because today, we're sharing: '10 People Who Twinned With Disney Characters By Accident'.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.800
Ukrainian Judge &amp; Ursula.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:38.280
This Ukrainian judge is the spitting image 
of one of Disney's most evil villains.

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.440
Here name is Alla Bandura
and she's a dead ringer for Ursula.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:44.840
The half-octopus, half woman character
from The Little Mermaid.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:47.320
When this photo of the judge was posted online...

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:51.740
...many people couldn't help but noticed 
she looked like Ursula's long-lost twin sister.

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:55.940
With her dramatic eye-makeup, her bright-red lipstick and her black and grey hair...

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:58.420
...Alla and Ursula are definitely twinning.

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.600
Lily Cole &amp; Merida.

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:05.780
There's a reason why everyone thinks 
Lily Cole looks a lot like Merida from "Brave".

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:09.720
The Disney princess was actually inspired 
by the English model and actress.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:15.520
When you look at photos of Lily and Merida side by side,
you can see how much these two look just alike.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:19.860
They both have same the wild and untamed curly hair,
the same pouty lips...

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:22.000
...and the same big and expressive eyes.

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:25.020
Joe Jonas &amp; Aladdin.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:27.220
Joe Jonas stepped out on 
the red carpet and...

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:30.180
...accidentally twinned 
with the Disney character Aladdin.

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:34.460
With his hair a bit longer, Joe looks like
he and Aladdin were separated at birth.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:37.800
They even have the same thick eyebrows
and the same big, brown eyes.

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:40.960
All Joe needs is a purple vest
and a pair of white Harem pants...

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:43.360
...to really become Aladdin's doppelganger.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:45.480
Twinning with Flash from Zootopia.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:51.200
You probably never thought it would be possible for a human to look exactly like Flash from Zootopia.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.680
But boy, were you wrong!

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:58.400
This girl looks exactly like the friendly and adorable character right down to her goofy facial expression...

00:01:58.400 --> 00:01:59.840
...and the shape of her eyes.

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:02.100
If Zootopia ever makes to Broadway...

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:05.720
...this girl should definitely 
play the role of the lovable sloth.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:08.100
Carl from "Up's" twin.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:11.800
Doesn't this guy look almost identical to 
Carl Fredricksen from Up?

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:15.020
He's practically the animated character's real-life twin.

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:20.280
If we didn't know any better, we would think Carl was definitely created with this man's image in mind.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:25.380
They have the same glasses, the same nose, 
the same white smile and the same bushy hair.

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:27.680
Chris Hemsworth &amp; John Smith.

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:31.680
Back when actor Chris Hemsworth was 
rocking a long and full head of hair...

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:35.620
...he was a dead ringer for the character 
John Smith in the movie Pocahontas.

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:37.680
He may not be an English explorer...

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:43.420
...but Chris definitely has the same blue eyes, perfectly styled hair and the same chiseled jawline as John.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:46.160
With a live-action remake of this movie is in the works...

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:49.920
...Disney doesn't have to look too far to 
cast Pocahontas' love interest.

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:52.400
Jean Sarkozy &amp; The Prince.

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:57.340
Without even knowing it, Jean Sarkozy is 
twinning with the prince of Beauty and The Beast.

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:01.860
Jean, who is the son of the former president of France,
is definitely the prince's lookalike.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:06.920
They've the same gorgeous head of hair, the same face shape and the exact same bushy eyebrows.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:09.000
The only difference is the color of their hair.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:14.180
But all Jean needs is a pair of blue contact lenses
to complete his transformation into the prince.

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:17.360
Cruella de Vil's 
real-life twin.

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:22.660
For some people, being compared to Cruella de Vil
of 101 Dalmatians, isn't a compliment.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:27.120
But we have to hand it to this lady, because she is definitely giving Cruella a run for her money.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:30.780
The woman was photographed looking
exactly like the puppy-obsessed villain.

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:32.920
She has the same multi-colored hair...

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:36.340
...and we even spot a bit of fur 
on the hood of her winter coat.

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:38.560
Elsa's long-lost sister.

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:42.860
There are many everyday people who think 
they look like Elsa from the movie Frozen.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.840
But we think this girl takes the cake.

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:48.220
She obviously thinks she looks a lot like 
the "Frozen" character too.

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:53.660
She took this photo next to a cutout of Elsa,
and we have to admit, the resemblance is uncanny.

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:58.520
They have the same facial expression, the same beautiful eyes and the exact same smile.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:03.240
All this girl needs is a beautiful blue dress
to really transform her into the Disney star.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:05.520
Khal Drogo &amp; Scar.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:10.460
How crazy is the resemblance between Jason Momoa's "Game of Thrones" charactor, Khal Drogo...

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:12.140
...and Scar from "The Lion King"?

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:17.100
The Warlord's tan skin and dark hair and features, 
really resembles Scar's appearance.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.400
Even though, Khal is a humand, and Scar is a Lion...

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:23.120
...that doesn't change the fact that 
these two are the spitting image of each other.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:24.240
Don't you agree?

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:28.000
Do you know anyone who looks like a 
real-life Disney character?

